      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Bicycle.Physics.BicycleParameters",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.Physics.BicycleParameters.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Complete parameter set for the canonical Whipple bicycle model.\nField values for <xref href=\"Bicycle.Physics.BicycleParameters.MeijaardBenchmark\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> follow Meijaard et al. 2007 Table 1.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Bicycle.Physics.BicycleSimulator.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Bicycle.Physics.BicycleSimulator.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Bicycle.Physics.BicycleSimulator",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.Physics.BicycleSimulator.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Integrates the full nonlinear Whipple bicycle equations of motion for a single bike.\nAllocation-free on the hot path — all intermediate storage is stack-allocated or\npre-allocated at construction time.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.Physics.BicycleSimulator.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"5\">Typical usage:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-csharp\">var sim = new BicycleSimulator(BicycleParameters.GameDefault);\nsim.Step(0.004, new ControlInputs { DriveTorque = -3.0 });\nref readonly var snap = ref sim.CurrentSnapshot();\n// snap.RearFrame.Position gives the rear-frame centre-of-mass in world space (Moore frame)</code></pre>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Bicycle.Physics.BicycleSnapshot.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Bicycle.Physics.BicycleSnapshot.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Bicycle.Physics.BicycleSnapshot",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.Physics.BicycleSnapshot.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">World-space pose and velocity of all four bicycle bodies, plus scalar\nsummary fields. This is the contract the (future) Unity layer reads from.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Bicycle.Physics.BicycleState.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Bicycle.Physics.BicycleState.html"
