      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Bicycle.Physics.BicycleState",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.Physics.BicycleState.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Integrated state of a bicycle. 8 generalized coordinates (Pitch is the dependent\ncoordinate, kept consistent with the front-wheel-on-ground holonomic constraint\nby the integrator) plus the 3 independent generalized speeds (RollRate, SteerRate,\nRearWheelSpinRate).</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.Physics.BicycleState.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"6\">Bit-blittable POD: <code>MemoryMarshal.AsBytes(ref state)</code> is safe.</p>\n"
    },
