      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Bicycle.Physics.ControlInputs",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.Physics.ControlInputs.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">External torques applied to the bicycle for one integration step.\nAll values default to zero. Positive sign conventions match Meijaard 2007.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.Physics.ControlInputs.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"4\">IMPORTANT — sign-convention inversions (gotchas #4 and #9):\nThe generated EOM treats positive <xref href=\"Bicycle.Physics.ControlInputs.DriveTorque\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> as decelerating (sign is\ninverted from typical expectation). Similarly, positive <xref href=\"Bicycle.Physics.ControlInputs.SteerTorque\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> steers\nleft from the rider's perspective. <code>FeelPreset.Default</code> in the <code>Bicycle.World</code>\npackage compensates with negative scales (-3.0 for drive, -1.5 for steer). A proper fix\nis deferred to Phase 3.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Bicycle.Physics.FrameBodyParameters.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Bicycle.Physics.FrameBodyParameters.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Bicycle.Physics.FrameBodyParameters",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.Physics.FrameBodyParameters.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Inertia properties of a frame body (RearFrame or FrontFrame), expressed in the\nreference posture defined by Meijaard 2007 (upright, zero steer, ground at z = 0).\nAssumes a vertical symmetry plane, so only Ixx, Ixz, Iyy, Izz are needed.\nMass-centre coordinates ComX, ComZ are in the reference frame's origin/axes.</p>\n"
    },
