      "Title": "Bicycle.Physics.Integrator",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.Physics.Integrator.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Sealed RK4 integrator over <xref href=\"Bicycle.Physics.BicycleState\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>. Caller supplies the\nderivative function. All scratch buffers are fields on this instance — no\nallocations during <xref href=\"Bicycle.Physics.Integrator.Step(Bicycle.Physics.BicycleState%40%2cSystem.Double%2cBicycle.Physics.Integrator.DerivativeProvider)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>.</p>\n"
    },
