      "Title": "Bicycle.World.BikeId",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.BikeId.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Stable identity for a single bike within a <xref href=\"Bicycle.World.BikeWorld\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>.\nWraps an <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/csharp/language-reference/builtin-types/integral-numeric-types\">int</a>; two <xref href=\"Bicycle.World.BikeId\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> values are equal iff\ntheir underlying integers are equal.</p>\n"
    },
