      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Bicycle.World.BikeSnapshot",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.BikeSnapshot.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">World-space poses of all four bicycle bodies for a single bike at a single\npoint in simulation time. This is the per-bike equivalent of\n<xref href=\"Bicycle.Physics.BicycleSnapshot\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> extended to carry identity information.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Bicycle.World.BikeWorld",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Orchestrates N independent bike simulations behind a clean event-driven\ncontract. Unity-side code calls <xref href=\"Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.Step(System.Double%2cSystem.Collections.Generic.IReadOnlyDictionary%7bBicycle.World.BikeId%2cBicycle.Physics.ControlInputs%7d)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> once per fixed update,\nthen reacts to <xref href=\"Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.OnBikeSnapshot\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>, <xref href=\"Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.OnBikeBump\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>, and\n<xref href=\"Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.OnBikeReset\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> events on the main thread.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"6\">Hard rules (see spec §6.1):</p>\n<ol sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"7\">\n<li sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"7\">Only one MonoBehaviour (<code>BikeWorldRunner</code>) ever holds a <xref href=\"Bicycle.World.BikeWorld\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> reference.</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"8\">No Unity code calls <xref href=\"Bicycle.Physics.BicycleSimulator.Step(System.Double%2cBicycle.Physics.ControlInputs%40%2cSystem.Double)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> directly.</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"9\">Every method takes a <xref href=\"Bicycle.World.BikeId\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> so N-bike operation is supported from day 1.</li>\n</ol>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"11\">Event causal ordering (spec §6.1):</p>\n<ul sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"12\">\n<li sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"12\">Snapshot events fire AFTER all simulators have stepped (consistent world-state slice).</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"13\">Bump events fire immediately when injected (per-bike causal ordering).</li>\n</ul>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"15\">Allocation-free design:</p>\n<ul sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"16\">\n<li sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"16\"><xref href=\"Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.OnBikeSnapshot\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> args are cached per-bike and updated in-place.</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"17\"><xref href=\"Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.OnBikeBump\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> and <xref href=\"Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.OnBikeReset\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> args are always newly allocated\n(rare events, not on the hot path).</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"19\">The step snapshot buffer is a List whose backing array is grown on AddBike and\nnever shrinks, so no per-step heap allocation occurs.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
