      "Title": "Bicycle.World.BumpEvent",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.BumpEvent.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Describes a single bump interaction between a bike and an obstacle.\n<xref href=\"Bicycle.World.BumpEvent.Tier\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> classifies the bump intensity (e.g. 1 = small tap, 2 = medium, 3 = hard).\n<xref href=\"Bicycle.World.BumpEvent.LeanSign\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> indicates which side the bike was leaning toward on impact:\n+1 = leaning right, -1 = leaning left.</p>\n"
    },
