      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Bicycle.World.Events.BikeResetEventArgs",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.Events.BikeResetEventArgs.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Raised after a bike has been reset to its upright-at-speed initial state\nvia <xref href=\"Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.Reset(Bicycle.World.BikeId)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Bicycle.World.Events.BikeSnapshotEventArgs.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Bicycle.World.Events.BikeSnapshotEventArgs.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Bicycle.World.Events.BikeSnapshotEventArgs",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.Events.BikeSnapshotEventArgs.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Raised after every successful <xref href=\"Bicycle.World.BikeWorld.Step(System.Double%2cSystem.Collections.Generic.IReadOnlyDictionary%7bBicycle.World.BikeId%2cBicycle.Physics.ControlInputs%7d)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> for each bike,\ncarrying both the previous and current snapshots so subscribers can\ncompute deltas (velocity, angular change, etc.) without storing state.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.Events.BikeSnapshotEventArgs.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"5\">Allocation-free design: instances are cached per-bike inside <xref href=\"Bicycle.World.BikeWorld\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>\nand updated in-place before each event raise (via <xref href=\"Bicycle.World.Events.BikeSnapshotEventArgs.Update(Bicycle.World.BikeId%2cBicycle.World.BikeSnapshot%40%2cBicycle.World.BikeSnapshot%40)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> — internal).\nSubscribers must not store a reference to this object across event calls; copy the\ndata they need from <xref href=\"Bicycle.World.Events.BikeSnapshotEventArgs.Previous\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> and <xref href=\"Bicycle.World.Events.BikeSnapshotEventArgs.Current\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> synchronously.</p>\n"
    },
