      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Bicycle.World.FeelPreset",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.FeelPreset.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Pure-C# POD that describes all tunable parameters controlling how a bike\n&quot;feels&quot; to the rider. This struct is constructed directly in xUnit tests and\nconverted from a Unity ScriptableObject (<code>BikeFeelPresetAsset</code>) in the\npresentation layer.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.FeelPreset.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"6\">Placeholder set of 5 fields for v2.0; the full ~30-field surface is introduced\nincrementally in v2.9 as feel-tuning progresses.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Bicycle.World.FeelPreset.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"9\">Polarity conventions match the gotcha documentation:\nSteerTorqueScale  negative = steer-right on right-arrow (gotcha #9)\nDriveTorqueScale  negative = accelerate on W (gotcha #4)</p>\n"
    },
